    "updated_at": "2022-06-11T17:09:24Z",
    "body": "`right_format`/RPROMPT aren't supported in nushell because it behaves differently than in other shells.\r\nIf you are fine with this, you can try adding this to your nushell config:\r\n\r\n```\r\nlet-env PROMPT_COMMAND_RIGHT = {\r\n    starship prompt --right\r\n}\r\n```\r\nSupport for things like status codes and job counts requires additional flags, though these aren't usually used in the right prompt.",
